// User convention everywhere in this EMS:
//   P_Batt > 0 = battery DISCHARGING to the home
//   P_Batt < 0 = battery CHARGING
//
// The SBS Modbus PAC3 sign can differ by register/source/firmware. In this flow
// we keep the sign as read because your current working state showed discharge
// correctly as positive. If your battery displays the wrong sign, change only this
// one line to: let P_net_batt_charge = -rawPac3;
